## Board elections
- The current board members had reached the end of their expected three year terms.
- Two board members, Iddo Friedberg and Hilyatuz Zahroh, declined to re-run for board seats. We thanked them for their service on the board.
- 7 board members stood for re-election: Peter Cock (President), Nomi Harris (Vice President), Heather Wiencko (Treasurer), Hilmar Lapp, Bastian Greshake Tzovaras, Chris Fields, and Caleb Kibet (board members at large).
- The members up for re-election gave brief statements
- The board members voted via electronic ballot (using Helios, which is an open-source voting platform).
- The election was closed at 8:21am PT by Hilmar.
- The 7 members standing for re-election were all elected by a majority of the voting board members
  - Peter, Hilmar, Heather, Caleb: 7 for, 1 abstain, 0 against
  - Nomi, Bastian, Chris,: 8, 0 abstain, 0 against
  - Tally: https://vote.heliosvoting.org/helios/e/obf-2026-Sep

